OL,4,BFA chief signs NDA to view Fifa sell-  
OL,5,Boff plot documents                     
OL,6,GFootball Association chair Debbie      
OL,7,GHewitt has signed a non-disclosure     
OL,8,Gagreement (NDA) as a condition of      
OL,9,Gviewing documents related to Fifa      
OL,10,Gpresident Gianni Infantino's failed    
OL,11,GWorld Cup sell-off plot.               
OL,13,FHewitt was granted access to the       
OL,14,Finformation at the world governing     
OL,15,Fbody's headquarters in Zurich.         
